      "type": "if",
      "systemPrompt": "You are a senior partner-level critic reviewing the final integrated strategy. Assess the document for: strategic coherence across all regions, executability within a professional-services firm, cultural sensitivity and balance, completeness of governance and escalation frameworks, and clarity of phased actions. Identify any remaining inconsistencies, gaps, or impractical elements. Provide your FULL assessment with detailed reasoning. Then on the VERY LAST LINE output EXACTLY ONE of these keywords: pass, revise.",
      "ifOptions": ["pass", "revise"],
      "ifMappings": {
        "pass": 7,
        "revise": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Executive Strategy Polisher",
      "role": "polisher",
      "type": "agent",
      "systemPrompt": "You are an executive communications specialist. Perform a final quality check and formatting pass on the integrated strategy. Ensure a clear executive summary, logical section flow, consistent terminology, bullet-pointed action items, and professional tone suitable for C-suite and regional managing partners. Do not alter strategic content; enhance clarity, readability, and presentation. Output the final polished document."
    }
  ],
  "explanation": "The pipeline opens with a Builder that drafts a comprehensive global AI-integration strategy across all four regions. A Refiner then hardens the draft with authentic cultural nuance specific to the Gulf, East Asia, Western Europe, and North America. A While-loop Critic validates that regional trust, job-security, and authority norms are adequately addressed, looping back to the Refiner up to three times if gaps persist. After passing, an Analyst surfaces implementation risks, compliance issues, and regional KPIs. A second Refiner synthesizes the strategy and risk analysis into a single executable document. An If-gate Critic performs a final coherence and executability review, routing back to the Synthesis Refiner for revision if needed. Finally, a Polisher delivers an executive-ready, professionally formatted strategy. This two-stage refinement with automated quality gating ensures cultural fidelity and strategic rigor without human-in-the-loop intervention."
}
